  message: "Evidence 2026-10-16/17 for the accrual mode (2): during an afternoon of tracker filing with the local dev unable to fast-forward (reconcile said 'flush failed ... CI failed' while the cron full-suite on dev's HEAD was red), every subsequent op re-flushed the whole dirty set: origin/dev gained 34 consecutive 'tracker: N files (M ops)' commits, ten of them byte-identical '12 files (9 ops)'. All local .ops were already identical to origin/dev; the ff was done by staging those identical files and 'git merge --ff-only'. Side effect fixed separately: those 34 commits aged docs/ARCHITECTURE.md past the 30-commit window (generate-architecture --check now excludes tracker-only commits)."  # ba6b
